    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「……そう、ですわね。かえでさんにお守りを持っていくのも、悪くはありませんわ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「わたしは、過去にばかり囚われて、現実を、そして未来を見ていなかった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「だから、かえでさんとわたしの明るい未来を願ったお守りを買って、渡しましょうか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ふふ。それにしても……やっぱり、隠しとおすのは無理でしたわね♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「ゆゆさんは、昔からお話をつくるのが好きだから、わたしのちっぽけな作り話なんて、すぐに見破ってしまう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "さくら",
    "text": "「今から追っても、わたしの運動神経ではかえでさんには追いつけませんし、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 12,
    "dress": "old-s-civvies",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-s-civvies_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 490
